                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>订阅某个频道或服务的人</p>

                <p><strong>💬 材料中的原句用法</strong></p>
                <blockquote>"I grew from zero to one million <strong>subscribers</strong> in just 18 months."</blockquote>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 职场场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Our channel gained 50,000 new <strong>subscribers</strong> after the product launch."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"I subscribe to several cooking channels for recipe ideas."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📚 学术场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Researchers track <strong>subscriber</strong> engagement metrics to study audience behavior."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
